{"id":"wb-8-668","name":"万木草堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"万木草堂","text":"万木草堂旧址位于中国广东省广州市越秀区大塘街道文德社区中山四路长兴里3号，为三间三进、两天井、硬山顶的青砖祠堂式建筑，面积663平方米。始建于清朝嘉庆九年（1804年），原是广东省邱氏子弟到省城应试的居住处，原名邱氏书室，故附近街坊俗称其邱家祠。在晚清时期，康有为在此创办了一所私立学堂。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E6%9C%A8%E8%8D%89%E5%A0%82","revisionId":93747737,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93747737","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ec82cdbf31ed7d5acf8938ab.jpg","title":"Guangzhou Wanmu Caotang 2014.01.26 14-21-21.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guangzhou_Wanmu_Caotang_2014.01.26_14-21-21.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/ff/Guangzhou_Wanmu_Caotang_2014.01.26_14-21-21.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"广州万木草堂","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}